# Test ASCII variants

# Numbers

Génn bind: (2 !=: 3), taxaw.
Génn bind: (2 <=: 2), taxaw.
Génn bind: (2 >=: 2), taxaw.

# Strings

Génn bind: (['b'] >=: ['a']), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['b'] !=: ['a']), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['b'] <=: ['c']), taxaw.

# Bools

Génn bind: (Dëgg !=: Dëkkul), taxaw.

# Objects

Génn bind: (Denc xees !=: Denc xees), taxaw.

# ASCII list symbol <-:

Génn bind: (Jokkalante <<: 1, ; 2 ; 3) waññ = 3, taxaw.

